vigilkit plugin-gb28181 (GB28181 SIP signaling skeleton)
Copyright 2026 vigilkit contributors

This package is implemented from RFC 3261 (SIP), RFC 4566 (SDP),
RFC 7616 (HTTP Digest authentication, adapted to the SIP Authorization
header) and GB/T 28181-2022 (公共安全视频监控联网系统信息传输、交换、控制
技术要求). It contains no third-party code; the digest helper is adapted
from the vigilkit plugin-hikvision package (same project, Apache-2.0).

